{"ok":true,"state":{"headline":"Monday is recorded and waits on one design from you: its story intro and outro. Wednesday has its workroom and waits on two calls from you. Friday waits on one call from you, then your recording.","signals":[{"text":"Working","label":"Writing AI","state":"ok"},{"text":"On, up to date, ready. Spare computer off","label":"Home computer","state":"ok"},{"text":"Exact Article 1 passed; official lock awaits your decision","label":"Writing system","state":"ok"},{"text":"GitHub key refreshed; next scheduled job will prove it","label":"Engine timers","state":"warn"},{"text":"Board Retry recovery live and rendered","label":"Control Center","state":"ok"},{"text":"One approved capped check completed; exact cost is not exposed","label":"AI spend, last 14 days","state":""},{"text":"No subject doubled today","label":"News velocity","state":"ok"}],"updated_by":"signals/news","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:31:25.622+00:00"},"items":[{"id":"week-publish-board-2026-10-19","lane":"on_you","rank":0,"area":"This week","title":"This week's publish board, 19 to 23 October","detail":"Start on the Ideas tab: pick one idea for each day (four or five checked ideas a day, your own three from last week marked). Then tick each step as you do it; every tick is saved at once, and the next session copies it onto the piece.","link":"https://content.krishraja.com/board/2026-10-19","link_label":"Open week of 19 October","prompt":null,"updated_by":"codex","created_at":"2026-10-18T10:51:33.907348+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:58:15.98+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"week_published","only_you":"post","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"you-launch-today","lane":"on_you","rank":0,"area":"Launch","title":"One cover left to swap: the launch post","detail":"Article 1 is done: checked 11 October, its cover is now the 3:2 one. Still open: the launch post (6 October) shows the Monday follow.the.money card as its cover and share image. In its settings, set the 3:2 launch cover from the chat as the cover and social image, then save. This closes itself once the post shows a different image.","link":"https://home.makeyourmindup.ai/publish/post/218938561","link_label":"Open the post settings","prompt":"Anything to change, or send the Substack link once it is live","updated_by":"control_center","created_at":"2026-10-05T10:52:26.021985+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:33:40.35+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"share_image_changed","only_you":"login","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{"url":"https://home.makeyourmindup.ai/p/welcome-to-my-new-ai-media-channel","was":"4b61bd44-f808-4245-9e23-26cc076ddb2d_1360x1110.png"},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"week-publish-board-2026-11-09","lane":"on_you","rank":0,"area":"This week","title":"This week's publish board, 9 to 13 November","detail":"Start on the Ideas tab: pick one idea each for Wednesday and Friday, four checked ideas a day. Monday is already made and recorded (Character.AI). Tick each step as you do it; every tick is saved at once, and the next session copies it onto the piece. The off-day options, your lock-down short among them with its script, are written but not on the board yet: the board refuses any off-day option until a code fix to its mix button lands.","link":"https://content.krishraja.com/board/2026-11-09","link_label":"Open this week's publish board","prompt":null,"updated_by":"claude_code","created_at":"2026-10-30T13:34:27.507207+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-30T13:34:27.286+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"week_published","only_you":"post","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"week-publish-board-2026-10-12","lane":"on_you","rank":0,"area":"This week","title":"This week's publish board, 12 to 16 October","detail":"One page for Monday, Wednesday and Friday. Tick each step as you do it; every tick is saved at once, and the next session copies it onto the piece. Wednesday's tab now shows your pick (Meta Muse) as picked, not made yet. Done when every day on it is at 100%.","link":"https://content.krishraja.com/board/2026-10-12","link_label":"Open week of 12 October","prompt":null,"updated_by":"codex","created_at":"2026-10-12T15:19:17.105031+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:58:15.98+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"week_published","only_you":"post","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"week-publish-board-2026-11-23","lane":"on_you","rank":0,"area":"This week","title":"This week's publish board, 23 to 28 November","detail":"Start with the ideas: four checked ideas each for Monday, Wednesday and Friday, five off-day options each for Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday, and Saturday's good news with its five hospital stories. The open options were made again on 16 Nov with each one's aim, humour and the feed post it beats, and nothing that went out in the last three weeks. Only your Approve puts an idea on its day. Tick each step as you do it; every tick is saved at once, and the next session copies it onto the piece. Researched with web search only: Drive and Firecrawl were not connected, so the Cold Ideas & Inspo folder was not read, and the Instagram inspo sheet could not be read, so the lookalike patterns come from the feed, whose newest post is 11 Nov.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-23","link_label":"Open this week's publish board","prompt":null,"updated_by":"claude_code","created_at":"2026-11-13T23:15:32.321236+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:14:24.46+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"week_published","only_you":"post","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"week-publish-board-2026-11-16","lane":"on_you","rank":0,"area":"This week","title":"This week's publish board, 16 to 21 November","detail":"Start on the Ideas tab. Thursday and Saturday were made again on 16 Nov where nobody had answered. Thursday keeps your four answered options and adds three: a carousel on Nod, a free AI that sits through the cancel screens for you; a carousel on claiming your business in ChatGPT; and a meme on United turning AI agents away. Saturday keeps the good news (one topic, AI helping people speak, sign and get around, 3 of 5 stories found; the Find the other 2 stories press fills it) and the 72 eggs meme, and adds three: an AI that beat eight brain-tumour experts and then made all eight better, a meme on the translator that copies your sigh, and a recipe-book short on Google's AlphaGenome 2. Everything you answered is as it was. Tick each step as you do it; every tick is saved at once, and the next session copies it onto the piece. Researched with web search only: Drive and Firecrawl were not connected, so the Cold Ideas & Inspo folder was not read.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-16","link_label":"Open this week's publish board","prompt":null,"updated_by":"claude_code","created_at":"2026-11-07T17:00:50.308507+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:39:45.524+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"week_published","only_you":"post","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"you-welcome-days","lane":"on_you","rank":1,"area":"Launch","title":"Swap two days in the free welcome email","detail":"The free subscribers' welcome email says Mondays are under.the.hood and Wednesdays follow.the.money. The schedule is the other way round. Change the two lines to: On Mondays, follow.the.money traces where the money goes in an AI deal and who ends up better or worse off. On Wednesdays, under.the.hood takes apart something that shipped and stamps every part real or theatre.","link":"https://home.makeyourmindup.ai/publish/settings","link_label":"Open the welcome email settings","prompt":null,"updated_by":"control_center","created_at":"2026-10-06T11:39:41.095914+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:33:40.35+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"his_word","only_you":"login","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"week-2026-11-30","lane":"on_you","rank":1,"area":"Week of 30 Nov","title":"What are we writing about this week? Pick Monday, Wednesday and Friday","detail":"Monday 30 Nov, follow.the.money: 4 options to choose from.\nWednesday 2 Dec, under.the.hood: 4 options to choose from.\nFriday 4 Dec, mind.the.gap: 4 options to choose from.\nPick each day on the publish board. Each piece is made after Claude interviews you on its story and you sign it off. Drop in any other idea you want fleshed out through Say it.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-30","link_label":"Open the publish board","prompt":null,"updated_by":"control_center_slate","created_at":"2026-11-22T12:00:52.675579+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:00:52.033+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"week_planned","only_you":"judgment","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"clock-2026-11-30-titles_picked","lane":"on_you","rank":2,"area":"Week of 2026-11-30","title":"Your Titles press for each day is late for the week of 2026-11-30","detail":"It was due 2026-11-23 02:30 UTC. This is your press.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-30","link_label":"Open the Record step","prompt":null,"updated_by":"control_center","created_at":"2026-11-23T02:31:03.182236+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-23T02:31:02.971+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"clock","only_you":"judgment","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{"row":"titles_picked","week":"2026-11-30"},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"growth-2026-10-14","lane":"in_progress","rank":2,"area":"Growth","title":"Growth pack Wednesday: 13 drafts to post (part 1 of 3)","detail":"PART 1 of 3 (parts 2, 3 are items growth-2026-10-14-b, -c). Muse piece https://home.makeyourmindup.ai/p/amazon-locked-metas-new-ai-out-walmart. Nothing posted.\nDO TODAY (~20 min): 1 LinkedIn post (part 2). 2 X thread (part 3). 3 Notes 1 and 2 now, 3 to 5 tomorrow. 4 SEO title and description (part 3). Calls record: none due.\nNOTES\n1 (now): I spent a week with Meta's Muse. Amazon has locked it out. Walmart let it in. Two giant shops, two opposite answers to the same AI. I broke down why in my review.\n2 (later today): Meta made $59.36 billion from advertising last quarter, out of $60.8 billion in revenue. That one number explains why Muse is free for most of what you need. When ads pay the bills, the more people use it, the better.\n3 (tmrw am): Amazon now shows a popup to anyone who tries to shop through Muse: \"Continued access by an unauthorized AI agent violates Amazon's Conditions of Use, to which our customers have agreed.\"\n\nMy read is that Amazon wants you shopping in Amazon's own app.\n4 (tmrw noon): A question for you. When you ask an AI for a flight, a gift or a table for dinner, do you want to know what it left out? I think every assistant should be asked: what were the other options? Do you ever ask yours?\n5 (tmrw eve): If you only read one thing about the new wave of AI assistants this week, make it my Muse review. It's about a simple idea: the assistant you pick may start deciding who you can buy from. https://home.makeyourmindup.ai/p/amazon-locked-metas-new-ai-out-walmart","link":"https://home.makeyourmindup.ai/p/amazon-locked-metas-new-ai-out-walmart","link_label":"Open","prompt":null,"updated_by":"claude_code","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:15:17.75649+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:23:10.19+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"his_word","only_you":null,"bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"clock-2026-11-30-week_picked","lane":"on_you","rank":2,"area":"Week of 2026-11-30","title":"Your picks on the Ideas tab is late for the week of 2026-11-30","detail":"It was due 2026-11-22 15:00 UTC. This is your press.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-30","link_label":"Open the Ideas tab","prompt":null,"updated_by":"control_center","created_at":"2026-11-22T15:01:05.375902+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-22T15:01:04.953+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"clock","only_you":"judgment","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{"row":"week_picked","week":"2026-11-30"},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"clock-2026-11-30-cuts_filed","lane":"on_you","rank":2,"area":"Week of 2026-11-30","title":"The overnight cuts filed for each day is late for the week of 2026-11-30","detail":"It was due 2026-11-23 11:00 UTC. A machine owns this, and nothing here can start it again; check the machine.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-30","link_label":"Open the publish board","prompt":null,"updated_by":"control_center","created_at":"2026-11-23T11:01:01.959959+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:01:01.632+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"clock","only_you":"judgment","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{"row":"cuts_filed","week":"2026-11-30"},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"clock-2026-11-30-scripts_sent","lane":"on_you","rank":2,"area":"Week of 2026-11-30","title":"Your Approve scripts press for each day is late for the week of 2026-11-30","detail":"It was due 2026-11-22 18:00 UTC. This is your press.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-30","link_label":"Open the Drafts step","prompt":null,"updated_by":"control_center","created_at":"2026-11-22T18:01:05.885241+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-22T18:01:05.335+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"clock","only_you":"judgment","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":null,"close_ref":{"row":"scripts_sent","week":"2026-11-30"},"closed_proof":null,"said":[]},{"id":"clock-2026-11-30-final_board_ready","lane":"on_you","rank":2,"area":"Week of 2026-11-30","title":"The Monday board with every cut is late for the week of 2026-11-30","detail":"It was due 2026-11-23 11