d_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:56.602044+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:01:04.167+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"clock","only_you":"judgment","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":"check: clock","close_ref":{"row":"final_board_ready","week":"2026-11-23"},"closed_proof":"The week of 2026-11-23 has gone live and its clock moved on."},{"id":"clock-2026-11-23-cuts_filed","lane":"archived","rank":2,"area":"Week of 2026-11-23","title":"The overnight cuts filed for each day is late for the week of 2026-11-23","detail":"It was due 2026-11-16 11:00 UTC. A machine owns this, and nothing here can start it again; check the machine.","link":"https://controlcenter.krishraja.com/#/content?week=2026-11-23","link_label":"Open the publish board","prompt":null,"updated_by":"done_check","created_at":"2026-11-16T11:00:56.801294+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:01:03.683+00:00","idea_id":null,"closes_on":"clock","only_you":"judgment","bumped_until":null,"closed_by":"check: clock","close_ref":{"row":"cuts_filed","week":"2026-11-23"},"closed_proof":"The week of 2026-11-23 has gone live and its clock moved on."}],"replies":[{"id":"9aef533e-d94c-4c1d-b68d-509d36e6ee21","item_id":"you-p1-brief","text":"ok this is much better. Ensure no other article is ever capable of being even 1% misinterpreted or confusing in the future, this is critical. We should also add parallels (when this has happened before), analogies to things people will relate to, or comical exaggerations to make the point where it does not distort fact.","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:50:33.234+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T22:04:33.963+00:00","seen_by":"codex"},{"id":"c5337291-0fb9-4f1a-be14-7b3740d64547","item_id":"you-studio-switchon","text":"I'm ready to watch one","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:48:25.366+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T22:04:33.963+00:00","seen_by":"codex"},{"id":"4b6aa742-0654-44b6-839b-176532f9a991","item_id":"you-outside-tools","text":"ok agreed, but start building an idea of the stack we can start piecining toegther once we have results","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:48:16.138+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T22:04:33.963+00:00","seen_by":"codex"},{"id":"ccea1908-0a7e-4102-a2ed-9fc7590fecd1","item_id":"you-security-live","text":"Make it live","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:18:25.668+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T21:35:27.339+00:00","seen_by":"codex"},{"id":"a7c57c0a-3e49-43ab-a176-97c2aa3c467b","item_id":"you-p1-brief","text":"I like the premise, but a) I hate the vernacular of \"still able to be nudged.\", \"On Sunday 20 September, Amazon started blocking a shopper who can't be nudged.\" - it is not easy to understand what that actually means. I never, ever want to say things that sound too smart and can be misinterpreted, things like this should be crystal clear as to what is happening, what does nudgeed even mean? Then yes this article really needs visuals throughout to make things clearer to understand and follow","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:18:12.755+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T21:35:27.339+00:00","seen_by":"codex"},{"id":"903ae5ea-2ae6-4d4e-91b6-3a19bbc68b8a","item_id":"you-p3-approve","text":"this is good - I like this","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:14:51.516+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T21:35:27.339+00:00","seen_by":"codex"},{"id":"60041af9-8333-49b3-b62f-aa5679f67280","item_id":"you-ticket-mock","text":"Looks good, I will need to be able to provide feedback at every step of the way in a very elegant and user friendly way, which gets ingested and stored for the next round of upgrades to the tool","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:14:10.758+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T21:35:27.339+00:00","seen_by":"codex"},{"id":"becbc5b7-b41e-4659-8f91-8863fba41221","item_id":"you-cut-judges","text":"Agree","by":"Krish","at":"2026-10-03T21:12:52.663+00:00","seen_at":"2026-10-03T21:39:35.965+00:00","seen_by":"codex"}],"unseen_replies":0}
